// ark.marco — ARK: Survival Evolved module, ported from MacroMarco's ark.ahk.
// The signature macro is the cloud-pull transfer: for each item, open the target
// inventory, open cloud pull, search the item, transfer all, close. Coordinates
// and timings match the original module.
//
// This runnable program performs the "rock me mama" preset — transfer stone +
// flint from the argent — exactly like `t rock me mama` in the AHK app.
//
//   marco run --host dryrun  programs/ark.marco   # see the steps
//   marco run --host windows programs/ark.marco   # drive the real game (ARK focused)

use os.

// The current transfer batch (the items to cloud-pull).
the Items is a list of text.

the Ark is an actor.

// Transfer every item in the batch. Window-scoped: only runs when ARK is the
// focused window (the host's Focus check stands in for MacroMarco's `scope
// window`).
this can TransferAll.
this's TransferAll does...
    do OS's Focus with "ShooterGame"...
        when ok?
            for each item in Items...
                do Ark's TransferOne with item.
            this is ok!
        or?
            this is failed with error "ARK window is not focused"!

// One item's cloud-pull sequence. `input` is the item name to search.
this can TransferOne.
this's TransferOne does...
    the argent is a Point with X 1258, Y 550.
    the cloudPull is a Point with X 1493, Y 28.
    the search is a Point with X 651, Y 209.
    the slot1 is a Point with X 618, Y 250.
    the transfer is a Point with X 1380, Y 255.
    the close1 is a Point with X 800, Y 874.
    the close2 is a Point with X 1027, Y 865.

    do OS's Click with argent.
    do OS's Sleep with 100.
    do OS's Click with cloudPull.
    do OS's Sleep with 100.
    do OS's Click with search.
    do OS's Sleep with 25.
    do OS's Type with input.
    do OS's Sleep with 25.
    do OS's Click with slot1.
    do OS's Sleep with 500.
    do OS's Click with transfer.
    do OS's Sleep with 500.
    do OS's Click with close1.
    do OS's Sleep with 25.
    do OS's Click with close2.
    do OS's Sleep with 25.
    this is ok!

// Context action: right-click an item, pick an action slot, confirm
// (ark.ahk `i`). Defaults to the first slot.
this can ContextAction.
this's ContextAction does...
    the slot1 is a Point with X 840, Y 900.
    the confirm is a Point with X 560, Y 900.

    do OS's Click with "right".
    do OS's Sleep with 1000.
    do OS's Click with slot1.
    do OS's Sleep with 500.
    do OS's Click with confirm.
    this is ok!

the App is a script.

// "rock me mama" — stone + flint from the argent.
put "stone" into Items.
put "flint" into Items.

do Ark's TransferAll...
    when ok?
        log "argent: stone, flint".
    or?
        log that's error.
